Package: com.ma6x9x.kernellab
Name: Kernellab
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: userspace micro-lab for iOS/XNU kernel research - decode the
 UC method tables of captured kernelcaches, live survivor-diff rows across
 iOS builds, and run real kernel bytes (CVE-2026-43748 fill-writer) under
 Unicorn per-function emulation. Corellium-inspired, image-holder-native:
 the guest is a real extracted kernel, the host is an emulator, the oracle
 is byte comparison. No caches included (operator-supplied).
Maintainer: kolby <noreply@github.com>
Author: kolbymaxx
Section: Research
Depends: python3
Homepage: https://github.com/ma6x9x/KernelLab